# Hosts the Speranța API may reach through its egress proxy: one anchored ERE per line, in CONNECT
# form "^host:port$" (FilterURLs On: plain-HTTP requests start with http:// and never match).
# Gmail SMTP (Email:Host/Port; a different mail provider needs its line here).
^smtp\.gmail\.com:587$
# Web Push: the push service each browser's subscription points at.
^fcm\.googleapis\.com:443$
^updates\.push\.services\.mozilla\.com:443$
^web\.push\.apple\.com:443$
^[a-z0-9-]+\.notify\.windows\.com:443$
